@file 37:
@file 38: ###############################################################################
@file 39: # GLOBAL & DETAILED ROUTING
@file 40: ###############################################################################
@file 41: ### Runs routing or postroute via or wire optimization using the NanoRoute router.
@file 42: ### -globalDetail : Runs timing-driven and SI-driven global and detailed routing.
@file 43: ### When specified, it unfixes the clock nets and then routes all nets, including clocks that still need to be routed.
@file 44: ### It does not ECO route the clock nets prior to other signals so clock nets are not given priority as they are with routeDesign.
